<title>SPAIN: Spanish bond yields fall at auction.</title>
<headline>Spanish bond yields fall at auction.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain announced the following results at today's Treasury debt auction (amounts bid, allocated in billions of pesetas):</p>
<p>ISSUE	Yield    Pvs     Price     Pvs	Bid    Allocated</p>
<p>3-year     7.054    7.698   101.65   99.35   303.673  110.663</p>
<p>10-year    7.950    8.921   109.50  102.50   403.464  203.857</p>
</text>
